port converters/simdutf
type port
target @any
reason "Rebuild with ports GCC 13 so libsimdutf links libstdc++.so.6, not base gcc8 libstdc++.so.9. simdutf is pulled by www/node24 (directly and via devel/merve); mixing .so.9 with node24 gcc13 .so.6 corrupts V8 Zone -> mksnapshot SIGSEGV. Unmaintained gate stays lifted; TOOLS excluded (sutf/fastbase64 std::filesystem, unneeded)."

mk set USE_GCC_VERSION "13"
mk set OPTIONS_EXCLUDE "TOOLS" on-missing noop
